This repository contains no source code from the bitchat project. It
implements the bitchat wire protocol from docs/protocol-spec.md, which was
written by reading the public-domain (Unlicense) bitchat iOS source at
https://github.com/permissionlesstech/bitchat. The GPL-3.0 bitchat-android
source was not read and is not used. openchat is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the bitchat project.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data shipped in the app
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

android/app/src/main/assets/relays.csv
  Nostr relay URLs with approximate coordinates, from
  permissionlesstech/bitchat relays/online_relays_gps.csv at tag v1.8.0.
  Public domain (Unlicense). Kept verbatim so geohash channels use the
  same relays as bitchat clients.

